      en: ["The monastery was founded around 1538.", "It was the headquarters of the Dominicans in Central America.", "The 1773 earthquake almost completely destroyed the buildings.", "Prominent colonial figures were buried in the crypts.", "The modern Hotel Casa Santo Domingo integrates the historical ruins.", "It houses museums for pharmacy, archaeology, and sacred art."],
