      en: ["Baroque and neoclassical elements", "Part of the historic center", "Important religious site", "Rebuilt after earthquakes"],
      es: ["Elementos barrocos y neoclásicos", "Parte del centro histórico", "Lugar religioso importante", "Reconstruida tras un terremoto"],
