      en: ["The decisive battle of the revolution occurred on June 30, 1871.", "Miguel García Granados served as the first provisional president.", "Justo Rufino Barrios was known as the movement's radical 'Reformer'.", "The revolution ended the political supremacy of the Catholic Church.", "Coffee became the primary export commodity following the reforms.", "The current design of the Guatemalan flag was established in 1871."],
