      en: ["UFCO controlled over 40% of the arable land in Guatemala at its peak.", "The company was the largest employer in the country during the early 1900s.", "The CIA operation to overthrow President Árbenz was codenamed 'PBSuccess'.", "UFCO operated the 'Great White Fleet' dedicated to banana transport.", "The corporation held a strategic monopoly over Guatemala's postal service.", "In 1970, UFCO merged to become United Brands Company, now known as Chiquita."],
      es: ["La UFCO controlaba más del 40 % del suelo fértil de Guatemala.", "La empresa fue el mayor empleador del país a principios del siglo XX.", "La operación de la CIA para derrocar a Árbenz tuvo el nombre clave 'PBSuccess'.", "UFCO operaba la 'Great White Fleet' para el transporte de banano.", "La empresa controlaba el monopolio del servicio postal guatemalteco.", "En 1970, la UFCO se fusionó para formar United Brands Company (hoy Chiquita)."],
      pt: ["A UFCO controlava mais de 40% das terras férteis da Guatemala.", "A empresa foi o maior empregador do país no início do século XX.", "A operação da CIA para derrubar Árbenz teve o codinome 'PBSuccess'.", "A UFCO operava a 'Great White Fleet' para o transporte de bananas.", "A empresa controlava o monopólio do correio guatemalteco.", "Em 1970, a UFCO fundiu-se na United Brands Company (hoje Chiquita)."],
      fr: ["L'UFCO contrôlait plus de 40 % des terres fertiles du Guatemala.", "L'entreprise était le plus gros employeur du pays au début du XXe siècle.", "L'opération de la CIA pour renverser Árbenz portait le nom de code 'PBSuccess'.", "L'UFCO exploitait la 'Great White Fleet' pour le transport des bananes.", "L'entreprise contrôlait le monopole de la poste guatémaltèque.", "En 1970, l'UFCO a fusionné pour devenir la United Brands Company (aujourd'hui Chiquita)."],
