      en: ["Signed on December 29, 1996, at the National Palace", "The internal conflict lasted for exactly 36 years", "An estimated 200,000 people died or disappeared during the war", "United Nations served as the official mediator for years", "URNG transitioned from a guerrilla group to a political party", "A fresh rose is placed daily at the Peace Monument"],
